    {
      "id": "1fX4QwgUDk38E9pnDN2NA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -50.625281932763755,
      "y": 12347.66273168318,
      "width": 1098.4163818359375,
      "height": 1155,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 845513476,
      "version": 1645,
      "versionNonce": 2064194236,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787298473440,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design Uber\n\nuber is a ride sharing platforms that connect passengers with drivers who\noffer transportation services in personal vechicles. it allows users to book rides\non demand from their smartphones, matching them with a nearby driver who\n will take them from their desired destination.\n\n\nFunctional Requirements \n\n- users should be able to input a start location and a destination and get an\nestimate fare\n- user should be able to request a ride based on an estimate\n- drivers should be able to accept/deny a request and navigate to pick/drop-off\n\n--out of scope--\n- multiple car types\n- ratings for drivers and riders\n- schedule a ride in advance\n\nNon-functional Requirements\n\n- low latency matching < 1 min to match or failure\n- consistency of matching. ride to driver is 1:1\n- highly available outside the matching\n- handle high throughout, surge for peak hours or special events\n\n-- out of scope --\n- resilience and handling system failures \n- monitoring, logging alerting etc.\n- CI/CD pipeline\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design Uber\n\nuber is a ride sharing platforms that connect passengers with drivers who\noffer transportation services in personal vechicles. it allows users to book rides\non demand from their smartphones, matching them with a nearby driver who\n will take them from their desired destination.\n\n\nFunctional Requirements \n\n- users should be able to input a start location and a destination and get an\nestimate fare\n- user should be able to request a ride based on an estimate\n- drivers should be able to accept/deny a request and navigate to pick/drop-off\n\n--out of scope--\n- multiple car types\n- ratings for drivers and riders\n- schedule a ride in advance\n\nNon-functional Requirements\n\n- low latency matching < 1 min to match or failure\n- consistency of matching. ride to driver is 1:1\n- highly available outside the matching\n- handle high throughout, surge for peak hours or special events\n\n-- out of scope --\n- resilience and handling system failures \n- monitoring, logging alerting etc.\n- CI/CD pipeline\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mLwyTGjqnwbmkObXHTW_5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -38.40653375709064,
      "y": 13524.735472606348,
      "width": 612.6146850585938,
      "height": 1295,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDi",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2130173116,
      "version": 529,
      "versionNonce": 1759563324,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787299141316,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Core Entities\n\n- Ride\n- Rider\n- Location\n- Driver\n\nAPI\n\n- POST /ride/fare-estimate -> partial ride\n\n        {\n            source,\n            destination\n        }\n\n- PATCH /ride/request/{ride id}\n- POST /location/update\n\n    {\n        lat,\n        long\n    }\n\n- PATCH /ride/drive/accept\n        {\n            rideID,\n            true/false\n        }\n\n- PATCH /ride/drive/update -> lat/long | null\n {\n    rideId,\n    status: 'pickup' | 'dropped off'\n}\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Core Entities\n\n- Ride\n- Rider\n- Location\n- Driver\n\nAPI\n\n- POST /ride/fare-estimate -> partial ride\n\n        {\n            source,\n            destination\n        }\n\n- PATCH /ride/request/{ride id}\n- POST /location/update\n\n    {\n        lat,\n        long\n    }\n\n- PATCH /ride/drive/accept\n        {\n            rideID,\n            true/false\n        }\n\n- PATCH /ride/drive/update -> lat/long | null\n {\n    rideId,\n    status: 'pickup' | 'dropped off'\n}\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7ITbRakBQqgTMCqzGUX1r",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1308.3710429393122,
      "y": 12413.110640444414,
      "width": 68.25602722167969,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
